    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48396" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέραψ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰπος</span>, ὁ, poet.,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεράπων</span>, rare in sg., <i><span class="en">
			<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
			415.3
		</span></i> (<span class="entity">Alexandria</span>): acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βακχιακὸν θέραπα</span> (of Anacreon) <i><span class="en">
